    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "DILUTION If\nyou purchase securities in this offering, assuming no sale of any pre-funded warrants and no exercise of the common warrants issued in\nconnection with this offering or the Placement Agent Warrants issued as compensation to the Placement Agent, your ownership interest\nwill be immediately diluted to the extent of the difference between the combined public offering price per share of our Common Stock\nand accompanying common warrants in this offering and the as adjusted net tangible book value per share of our Common Stock immediately\nafter giving effect to this offering. Our\nnet tangible book value as of June 30, 2026 was approximately $4.2 million, or approximately $0.90 per share of our Common Stock. Our\nnet tangible book value is the amount of our total tangible assets minus total liabilities. Net tangible book value per share as of June\n30, 2026 is our net tangible book valu",
